<</Company(şÿu5QlSøX_:rH)/Creator(Scientific Research Publishing)/Producer(Acrobat Distiller 9.0.0 \(Windows\); modified using iText® 5.4.4 ©2000-2013 1T3XT BVBA \(AGPL-version\))/Title(Stability Analysis on Power System with Large Power Source)/Keywords(Power System with Large Power Source; Stability Analysis; Energy Balance)/Subject( In this paper, the stability problems of power systems with large power source are analyzed with viewpoint of energy balance. The phenomena are studied when the energy delivery are blocked by faults that occur on some key transmission lines of a large power source within a power system, on the transmission lines between the interconnected power systems, or on some key buses. The cases are based on a practical power system and its interconnected systems. )/ModDate(D:20131224172645+08'00')/SourceModified(D:20130719062529)/Author(Huabo Shi, Xiaoyan Zhou)/CreationDate(D:20130809115557+08'00')>>
